From 96acfa3e51468b5dbfac172cfc19a3e20e0e886e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Hoskinson <charles.hoskinson@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:03:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] sherlock-lfr: E3 J1 and J2, public values of L through L_Fr

Entry::Public in part 2 of the L verifier tape (per-AIR public value
addresses from part 1). D-6 carrier: two one-hot selector groups bind n
public words to trace cells with the stock backend; used by the L-side
interface AIRs (iface_l: Stmt, LogEntry, LogValue, Call, the 12,164-word
index table) and by the multi-row PublicAir of L_Fr (16 words per row,
Tape::expose). Native reference iface.rs: layout, log entries with
Midnight Poseidon values, OD-17 planner, decoder of the L_Fr words.
Test j1_public: small L_iface proof through L_Fr, changed L public value
and four carrier controls refused.
